"Cap_Cube_Papers" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=pink>[Handwritten Note]</font></span></face><br><br>Villainous Things to Do:<br><br>- push someone into a water cooler<br>- muss someone's hair<br>- cut in line<br>- don't tip at lunch<br>- put 'out of order' signs on the bathroom<br>- stick gum under table<br><br><font color=pink>[scribbles and doodling]</font><br><br>- knock over a convenience store<br>- steal a car<br><br><font color=pink>[more scribbles and doodling]</font><br><br>DON'T FORGET!<br><br>- call mom<br>- pick up Katie from preschool<br>- write thank-you notes for birthday gift"

